  "ownerUpdates": [
   {
    "text": "Festive specials at Dishoom. Come in for a Turkey Raan Bun. Spiced turkey, slow-cooked until meltingly tender, charred, pulled and tucked into a soft bun with rich gravy. Festive, speedy and satisfying. Simply walk in.",
    "buttonText": "Learn more",
    "buttonLink": "https://www.dishoom.com/menu/christmas-feast-menu/?utm_source=google&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gbp_post&utm_content=quick_walk-in_lunch:_turkey_raan_bun",
    "date": "2026-11-20T12:00:16.000Z",
    "imageUrl": "https://gz0.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipOMKo5nlHphTogTDwAvLxw0gDTyAnSlDG6eDz4t=h400-no"
   },
   {
    "text": "Gather loved ones, our Festive Feasts have arrived in cafe. Turkey Raan, rich gravy, chilli sprouts, black daal, then Tipsy Orange Cream Cake to finish. All are welcome, book your table now.",
    "buttonText": "Book",
    "buttonLink": "https://www.dishoom.com/reservations/?utm_source=google&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gbp_post&utm_content=friendsmas_at_dishoom",
    "date": "2026-11-19T17:15:16.000Z",
    "imageUrl": "https://gz0.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipMizgfvoq_fwn_1buXvY1cTxaJhJf7uxtxipltp=h400-no"
   },
   {
    "text": "Gather loved ones for an abundant vegetarian or vegan feast, dreamt up by Michelin-starred Chef Vikas and our own Chef Arun. The crowning joy – a beloved Bungalow favourite – Spice Roasted Pineapple. (Also available as a special on our All Day menu.)\n\n\nDiwali Feast menu available in café Monday 2nd – Sunday 15th November from 12pm, for two or more to share from £30 per person. \n",
    "buttonText": "Book",
    "buttonLink": "https://www.dishoom.com/reservations/?utm_source=google&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gbp_post&utm_content=diwali_feasting",
    "date": "2026-11-09T15:23:15.000Z",
    "imageUrl": "https://gz0.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipMA1v2wHVZxnqwicLv39JgDhkmhw1uv8n-Xt_DN=h400-no"
   },
   {
    "text": "Among the many new delicacies: Chai-misu. \nVanilla sponge-fingers soaked in coffee-spiked chai syrup and layered with satin-smooth mascarpone. Merriment enough for 2–3 people.\nAvailable daily from 12pm. All are welcome. ",
    "buttonText": "Book",
    "buttonLink": "https://www.dishoom.com/reservations/?utm_source=google&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gbp_post&utm_content=chai-misu",
